load @term/seed/structure/set
  find set

# An interpretation: an assignment of meaning to a formal language, sending its symbols to elements, functions, and
# relations of a structure, so that each sentence becomes true or false. A model is an interpretation that makes the
# axioms true. Interpretation is the bridge from syntax to semantics. The form carries the set the language is
# interpreted over (the domain of discourse).
form interpretation
  link domain, like set
